# The pictures of section-view.md: a block with a bore through it, cut
# parallel to its front face through the bore's axis.
cursor on
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key c
move 290 265
down L 290 265
up L 290 265
move 320 265
down L 320 265
up L 320 265
key esc
key x shift
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
click-face side face of g003-extrude from r005-line-segment
shot section-view-1-face gw
menu View|Section View
# At offset 0 the plane lies on the face clicked; the screen moves it.
twmove 190 133
mark 158 122 82 22 tw
shot section-view-2-screen tw
twmove 190 133
twdown L 190 133
twup L 190 133
edit -13
cursor off
shot section-view-3-axis
